# Lector AI is BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) — there is no backend.
# These keys are configured INSIDE the extension's Settings UI, not here.
#
# Pick a provider and paste your key in the extension:
#   - OpenAI:        https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#   - Anthropic:     https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
#   - OpenRouter:    https://openrouter.ai/keys   (one key, all models)
#   - Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint (DeepSeek, Groq, Together, Ollama, …)
